  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "995ab3c5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 信号滤波\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "005c10a8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**滤波**是指输入信号的振幅和/或相位的变化。**滤波器**的典型任务之一，是去除信号中的不需要的高频分量，并放大有用的低频分量。\n\n<center>\n\n![2-2.jpg](attachment:2-2.jpg)\n\n</center>\n\n**滤波器的频率响应**是指其增益与信号频率之间的关系。滤波器会在某些频带内放大信号，而在其他频带内衰减信号。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2-2.jpg": {
          "image/jpeg": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8c1832f6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 频率选择性滤波器的类型\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "920782a2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "* **低通滤波器（LPF）** – 通过低于指定截止频率的低频信号，并衰减高频信号；\n* **高通滤波器（HPF）** – 抑制低频信号，并通过高频信号；\n* **带通滤波器** – 仅通过特定频率带内的信号，并衰减所有其他频率带的信号；\n* **带阻滤波器** （或**陷波滤波器**） – 抑制特定频率带内的信号，并通过所有其他频率带的信号；\n* **谐振滤波器** – 仅让单一特定频率的信号通过；\n* **带阻滤波器** – 抑制单一特定频率的信号。\n\n图中示意性地展示了这些滤波器类型的频率响应曲线。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\n![3-1.jpg](attachment:3-1.jpg)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3-1.jpg": {
          "image/jpeg": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "99e2a1ae",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 以低通滤波器为例说明滤波器规格\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0698e4c7",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "让我们更详细地探讨**低通滤波器（LPF）**。它允许低频信号通过至某个截止频率，并衰减高频信号。此类滤波器的频率响应曲线如图所示：\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\n![3-2.png](attachment:3-2.png)\n\n</div>\n\n在低通滤波器的频率响应中，可以识别出三个主要的参数：\n\n* **通带**是有效信号必须位于其中的频率范围。通带边界为频率$F_p$。该频率是在峰值下方–3 dB处测得的。理想情况下，该频带内的信号增益应保持恒定；但在实际中，频率响应会呈现纹波，其允许电平由参数$A_p$ （dB）决定。\n\n* **阻带**是必须保证信号至少被衰减$A_{st}$ dB的频率范围。阻带始于频率$F_{st}$。\n\n* **过渡带**位于这两个带宽之间。该带宽内的增益逐渐减小。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3-2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6d00ee84",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## AnyMath滤波器模块\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2da7c8d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**AnyMath**提供了一组用于滤波器分析、设计和实现的模块。这些模块位于**信号处理** ->**滤波器**库中。\n\n<center>\n\n![3-3.png](attachment:3-3.png)\n\n</center>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3-3.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0a8e4d85",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 使用**Notch-Peak Filter** 模块进行滤波\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3574f157",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Notch-Peak Filter** 模块是一个具有可配置参数的二阶 IIR 陷波/峰值滤波器。它使用指定的中心频率和 3 dB 带宽，对输入信号随时间进行滤波。该模块位于 **Signal Processing** 库 -> **Filters** -> **Filter Designs** 中。\n\n该模块需要以下参数：\n\n* **Filter specification** 是模块用于设计滤波器的参数或系数。默认设置为 `Bandwidth and centre frequency`（使用参数 **3 dB bandwidth (Hz)** 和 **Notch/Peak center frequency (Hz)** 进行滤波器设计）。\n* **3 dB bandwidth (Hz)** 即 3 dB 带宽。\n* **Notch/Peak center frequency (Hz)** 是陷波/峰值滤波器的中心频率。\n* **Input sample rate (Hz)** 是输入信号的采样率。\n\n接下来，您将构建一个模型，读取文件 `MysterySig1.wav`，其中包含语音信号和频率为 $7350$ Hz 的纯音干扰。随后使用 **Notch-Peak Filter** 模块滤除该噪声。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "83b89f82",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务1\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7b6b8400",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "将包含干扰的信号加载到模型中，并绘制其频谱：\n\n1. 创建一个新模型。向模型中添加一个**From Multimedia File** 模块。在模块设置窗口中，将**File name**参数的值设置为`MysterySig1.wav`，并将**Samples per audio channel**的值设置为`1`。\n2. 向模型中添加一个**Terminator** 模块。将其输入连接到**From Multimedia File** 模块的输出端。\n3. 记录**From Multimedia File** 模块的输出信号。\n4. 在模型设置窗口中，将仿真时间设置为`5`秒，步长设置为`1/22050`。\n5. 运行模型。绘制频域中的信号图。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n该模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![3-4.png](attachment:3-4.png)\n\n</center>\n\n信号频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![3-5.png](attachment:3-5.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3-4.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "3-5.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "39622493",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务2\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "460f85cf",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "滤除噪声：\n\n1. 在模型中添加一个 **Notch-Peak Filter** 模块。将该模块连接在 **From Multimedia File** 模块与 **Terminator** 模块之间。\n2. 在模块设置窗口中，设置以下模块参数：\n\n#|\n||\n\n参数\n\n|\n\n**Filter specification**\n\n|\n\n**3 dB bandwidth (Hz)**\n\n|\n\n**Notch/Peak center frequency (Hz)**\n\n|\n\n**Input sample rate (Hz)**\n\n||\n||\n\n值\n\n|\n\n`Bandwidth and centre frequency`\n\n|\n\n`200`\n\n|\n\n`7350`\n\n|\n\n`22050`\n\n||\n|#\n\n3. 记录 **Notch-Peak Filter** 模块的输出信号。\n4. 运行模型。在同一张图上绘制原始信号和滤波后信号的频域图。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![3-6.png](attachment:3-6.png)\n\n</center>\n\n信号频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![3-7.png](attachment:3-7.png)\n\n</center>\n\n频谱显示，滤波后的信号中 $7350$ Hz 处的干扰已消失。\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3-6.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "3-7.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3d6fc18c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 使用**Biquad Filter** 模块进行滤波\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "be1d708a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Biquad Filter** 模块模拟双二阶 IIR 滤波器。该模块实现系数为固定值的静态 IIR 滤波器。该模块位于 **Signal Processing** 库 -> **Filters** -> **Filter Implementations** 中。\n\n滤波器系数可在模块设置窗口中以 SOS（二阶分段）矩阵形式指定，或通过输入端口输入。SOS 矩阵（参数 **SOS matrix (Mx6)**）是尺寸为 $M \times 6$ 的矩阵，其中 $M$ 是节的数量。SOS 矩阵的每一行包含相应滤波器节的分子和分母系数（$b_{ik}$ 和 $a_{ik}$）：\n\n$$\n\begin{pmatrix}\nb_{01} & b_{11} & b_{21} & a_{01} & a_{11} & a_{21} \\\nb_{02} & b_{12} & b_{22} & a_{02} & a_{12} & a_{22} \\\n... & ... & ... & ... & ... & ... \\\nb_{0M} & b_{1M} & b_{2M} & a_{0M} & a_{1M} & a_{2M}\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n首项分母系数 $(a_{01}, a_{02}, ..., a_{0M})$ 均等于 1。\n\n缩放系数（参数 **Scale values**）用作各滤波器节的增益。您可以指定一个实数标量，或长度为 $M+1$ 的向量，其中 $M$ 是 SOS 矩阵的第二维。如果指定标量，其值将决定二阶滤波器第一级之前的增益。其余增益系数默认设置为 $1$。如果指定值向量，则每个值将决定滤波器各级的增益。\n\n在接下来的任务中，您将使用 **Biquad Filter** 模块实现一个低通滤波器，并将其应用于信号 `MysterySig1.wav`。结果，原始信号中的所有高频分量以及 7350 Hz 的纯音信号都将被抑制。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8264f1c5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务3\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b0d35b2e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "修改上一任务中构建的模型：\n\n1. 从模型中移除**Notch-Peak Filter** 模块。将其替换为**Biquad Filter** 模块。\n\n2. 在模块设置窗口中，将**Coefficient source**的值设置为`Dialog parameters`，并将**Filter structure**的值设置为`Direct Form II`。\n\n3. 将**SOS matrix (Mx6)**的值设置为以下矩阵：\n\n```\n[1 2 1 1 -0.7827 0.9412; 1 2 1 1 -0.8560 0.8308; 1 2 1 1 -1.0198 0.7273; 1 2 1 1 -1.2259 0.6351; 1 2 1 1 -1.4028 0.5679; 1 1 0 1 -0.7367 0]\n```\n\n4. 将**Scale values**的值设置为向量\n\n```\n[0.2896 0.2437 0.1769 0.1023 0.0413 0.1317 1]\n```\n\n其余模块参数保持默认值。\n\n5. 记录**Biquad Filter** 模块的输出信号。\n\n6. 运行模型。在同一画布上绘制原始信号和滤波后信号的频域图。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![3-8.png](attachment:3-8.png)\n\n</center>\n\n信号频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![3-9.png](attachment:3-9.png)\n\n</center>\n\n频谱显示，原始信号中高频分量的功率已被衰减，但对应于$7350$赫兹音调信号的峰值并未完全消失。\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3-8.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "3-9.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
