          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c6259cda",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在接下来的任务中，您将加载语音信号`MysterySig2.wav`，该信号受到有色噪音的干扰（有色噪音的频谱分布不均匀，与白色噪音不同），使用低通滤波器去除噪音成分，该滤波器的系数将在**Filter Designer**应用程序中计算。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3d4c2c87",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务4\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b5fcca23",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "将包含噪音的信号加载到模型中，并绘制其频谱：\n\n1. 创建一个新模型。向模型中添加**From Multimedia File** 模块。在模块设置窗口中，将**File name**设置为`MysterySig2.wav`，并将**Samples per audio channel**参数设置为`1`。\n2. 向模型中添加**Terminator** 模块。将其输入端连接到**From Multimedia File** 模块的输出端。\n3. 对**From Multimedia File** 模块的输出信号进行日志记录。\n4. 在模型设置窗口中，将仿真时间设置为`5`秒，步长设置为`1/22050`。\n5. 运行模型。绘制频域信号图。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n该模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![3-11.png](attachment:3-11.png)\n\n</center>\n\n信号频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![3-12.png](attachment:3-12.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3-11.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "3-12.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
