        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1ff61864",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "29c4da9f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "使用**Filter Designer**应用程序设计一个低通滤波器：\n\n1. 打开**Filter Designer**应用程序。\n\n2. 设置以下滤波器参数值：\n\n* **滤波器频率响应类型** –`Lowpass filter`;\n* **滤波器合成方法** –`FIR`,`Uniform`;\n* **滤波器阶数** –`Minimum order`;\n* **频率网格密度** –`20`.\n\n频率要求：\n\n* **单位** –`Hz`;\n* **采样频率Fs** –`22050`;\n* **通带频率Fpass** –`7500`;\n* **阻带频率Fstop** –`8000`.\n\n振幅要求：\n\n* **单位** –`dB;`\n* **纹波 (Apass)** –`1`;\n* **衰减 (Astop)** –`40`.\n\n3. 点击**Filter Synthesis** 按钮。\n\n4. 点击**Filter Coefficients** 按钮。将分子系数保存到计算机中，文件名为`num.txt`。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n<center>\n\n![5 задание 5.png](attachment:5 задание 5.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5 задание 5.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
