    {
      "id": "ad05dbcf",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务6\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5df9f6e0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "使用设计的滤波器运行滤波：\n\n1. 返回您的模型。在模型中添加一个**Discrete FIR Filter** 模块。该模块位于**Basic** ->**Discrete**库中。将其连接在**From Multimedia File** 模块与**Terminator** 模块之间。\n2. 从`num.txt`文件中复制滤波器系数向量，并将其粘贴到**Discrete FIR Filter** 模块设置窗口中**Coefficients**参数的值字段中。\n3. 对**Discrete FIR Filter** 模块的输出信号进行记录。\n4. 运行模型。在同一画布上绘制原始信号和滤波后信号的频域图。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![3-13.png](attachment:3-13.png)\n\n</center>\n\n信号频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![3-14.png](attachment:3-14_2.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "3-13.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
